  "description": "\"You don't kiss your sister\"  \nIt was a photo posted on SNS that led Dojun to Korea for the first time in 10 years.  \nThe moment I saw her, in the picture imprinted on his head, she was his sister without a drop of blood.  \nJeA called to the club to attend the new president's celebration party.  \nBlinded by the prize money, she is drawn into the VVIP room by someone's hand to make a bet to take a picture of the president.  \nIn the pitch-black darkness, a familiar tap that penetrates the ear.  \n\"Talk, talk, talk, talk, talk, talk.\"  \nIt was a code that only he and she knew.  \nHer heart, which was dead, starts beating subtly… (MTL)\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=2428688)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://m.series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9174629), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60960665), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4516000382), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=220856), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000056356), [Blice](https://www.blice.co.kr/mw/detail.kt?novelId=92045) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000675), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/153219)",
